  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 375 degrees.",
    "roll out lamination puff pastry to a thickness of 1/4 inch.",
    "spread 2 cups of rolled oats evenly over the center of the pastry, leaving 1 inch of space around the edges.",
    "fold the edges of the pastry up over the oats to form a crust.",
    "brush the edges of the pastry with egg wash made from 1 cup of water.",
    "bake for 30 minutes or until golden brown."
